default max_time_diff: 60000
clock right: echo:ping
clock 30 s fast: echo:ping
clock 30 s slow: echo:ping
clock 5 minutes fast: error: reality: server did not sign with ed25519
clock 5 minutes slow: error: reality: server did not sign with ed25519
check switched off, 5 minutes fast: echo:ping
wider window, 5 minutes slow: echo:ping
